Consider refactoring to switch statement for better readability:

switch (arg) {
  case '--provider':
    parsed.provider = args[++i];
    break;
  case '--model':
    parsed.model = args[++i];
    break;
  case '--prompt':
    parsed.prompt = args[++i];
    break;
}

This makes it easier to add new parameters in future.
